&lt;h2 class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" data-section-id="1dfch1y" data-start="229" data-end="245"&gt;About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="247" data-end="339"&gt;Build the manufacturing test solutions that help every Graphcore system perform as designed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="341" data-end="529"&gt;This role exists to ensure our hardware is tested thoroughly from product introduction through to volume manufacturing. Your work will improve product quality and manufacturing confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="531" data-end="730"&gt;You will design and develop test software for advanced computing systems. You will work closely with hardware engineers, software teams, and manufacturing partners to deliver reliable test solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="732" data-end="867"&gt;You'll solve challenging hardware and software problems using data, engineering judgement, and close collaboration across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id="1pc0zxi" data-start="869" data-end="892"&gt;The team and culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="894" data-end="1094"&gt;The Product Test and Diagnosis team finds, understands, and manages hardware defects across chips, boards, and complete systems. The team supports products throughout manufacturing and into the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1096" data-end="1266"&gt;Day to day, you'll work closely with hardware design, software, silicon, and manufacturing teams. Decisions are driven by evidence, test results, and root cause analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1268" data-end="1459"&gt;You'll take ownership of your work while sharing knowledge with colleagues and manufacturing partners. Everyone is expected to contribute ideas that improve product quality and test coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
